{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782250/extras/c31e15c76eb5cebe439762dfa9eb1af7.avif?t=1760660608\" width=1500 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hatae: Guardians Demo</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the <strong>Trials of Geumgang Mountain</strong> with combat, growth, and boss encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a selection of skills and experiment with different combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> approx. 30\u201360 minutes<br><strong>Available Content:</strong> Trial challenges, selected boss/elite battles, basic progression for Hatae and the Prince</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full release will include more story chapters, new regions, additional character progression systems, and\u2014most importantly\u2014an expanded variety of trials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hatae: Guardians</i> is a fantasy action-adventure set in the world of Joseon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Four Guardian Deities, once protectors of the land, have faltered, and malevolent creatures have begun to invade Joseon. In this time of crisis, the protagonist is chosen by the Yellow Dragon and embarks on a journey with <strong>Hatae</strong>, the mythical guardian beast, to purify the corrupted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the adventure unfolds, you will uncover the cause of the calamity, the truth behind the Guardians\u2019 downfall, and the hidden stories that shape this land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hatae: Guardians</i> features intuitive and straightforward controls with a focus on <strong>tense, challenging combat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By mastering our unique <strong>evasion mechanics</strong>, players can enjoy battles that are both strategic and exhilarating. Hatae\u2019s purification abilities allow you to stagger bosses and elite monsters once you deal enough damage, opening windows for powerful counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through its distinctive action system and the strategic use of Hatae\u2019s powers, the game offers a fresh take on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Hatae and the Prince can be developed in their own ways, and players can experiment with different builds and combinations for varied gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782250?t=1760660608","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782250/d6e9bdcd8be4e7bbe41e2ed95565dceac41c435c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760660608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782250/bf2d9df4a73603819151f41b531faf9fe1e205d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760660608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782250/bf2d9df4a73603819151f41b531faf9fe1e205d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760660608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782250/extras/c31e15c76eb5cebe439762dfa9eb1af7.avif?t=1760660608\" width=1500 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hatae: Guardians Demo</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the <strong>Trials of Geumgang Mountain</strong> with combat, growth, and boss encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a selection of skills and experiment with different combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> approx. 30\u201360 minutes<br><strong>Available Content:</strong> Trial challenges, selected boss/elite battles, basic progression for Hatae and the Prince</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full release will include more story chapters, new regions, additional character progression systems, and\u2014most importantly\u2014an expanded variety of trials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hatae: Guardians</i> is a fantasy action-adventure set in the world of Joseon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Four Guardian Deities, once protectors of the land, have faltered, and malevolent creatures have begun to invade Joseon. In this time of crisis, the protagonist is chosen by the Yellow Dragon and embarks on a journey with <strong>Hatae</strong>, the mythical guardian beast, to purify the corrupted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the adventure unfolds, you will uncover the cause of the calamity, the truth behind the Guardians\u2019 downfall, and the hidden stories that shape this land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hatae: Guardians</i> features intuitive and straightforward controls with a focus on <strong>tense, challenging combat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By mastering our unique <strong>evasion mechanics</strong>, players can enjoy battles that are both strategic and exhilarating. Hatae\u2019s purification abilities allow you to stagger bosses and elite monsters once you deal enough damage, opening windows for powerful counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through its distinctive action system and the strategic use of Hatae\u2019s powers, the game offers a fresh take on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Hatae and the Prince can be developed in their own ways, and players can experiment with different builds and combinations for varied gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":[" JipangYiGames.Corp"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2854210","name":"HaeTae: Guardians"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782250/8d4328e0c58dae3452ede714ed3ef62a448924ab/header.jpg?t=1760660608","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3782250/188623723/54a7bd4990f995c3032d6f469aac9acdef8068d3/1760659803/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760660606","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3782250/188623723/54a7bd4990f995c3032d6f469aac9acdef8068d3/1760659803/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760660606","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3782250/188623723/54a7bd4990f995c3032d6f469aac9acdef8068d3/1760659803/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760660606","id":257219009,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219009/movie480.mp4?t=1760660606","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219009/movie_max.mp4?t=1760660606"},"name":"HaeTaeVideo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219009/a39ccd836e8e037bc10b2e56970b3c23776d696f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760660606","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219009/movie480.webm?t=1760660606","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219009/movie_max.webm?t=1760660606"}}],"name":"HaeTae: Guardians Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":